  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, for infinitely many solutions,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now checking for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
